- **D400 validation and timeout handling are fixed.** The wrapper uses the collector’s parser, rejects duplicate rows, and treats timeouts as voids. The no-ask-again rule is still incomplete. Running `read` again retries exhausted sessions because it checks only for an answer file. The report also retains the collector’s line 4 result when a packet is missing. Treat exhausted sessions as terminal and mark the draw’s reader lines unmeasured. [Validation](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/d400_reader_lines.py:169) · [Retry and report](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/d400_reader_lines.py:335) · [D675](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:9842) · [Timeout](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/census/census_readers.py:122)
- **Step 2’s manifest strata, quote flags, shared dossier context and pooled totals are fixed.** V7 still says the four attribution fields count against line 3, contradicting D675 and v7’s own key definition. Delete that sentence. Tell key readers to count facts from the statement and use the visible publisher and publication date only as context. [Packets](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/step2_lines.py:181) · [Strata](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/step2_lines.py:364) · [Line 3](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/step2_lines.py:632) · [Conflicting sentence](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/DESIGN-1.6.md:98) · [D675](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:9827)
- **D431 is fixed as recorded.** Eligibility packets show stored units. Numeric agreement is withheld for missing or different units. Two identity adjudicators are used, and a split stays unresolved. [Units](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/d431_reading.py:441) · [Adjudication](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/d431_reading.py:551) · [Comparison](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-17-product-comparison/stage0/d431_reading.py:686)

